    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8934f0b9e8bff492dfae2333",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正因为如此，她才能走到今天这一步，\n往后一定也没问题。然而……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cd2e82a5ebc3012cdfb79cf88629ac6c09b880c542a370b9aedce4270b17312",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
