      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她完全没有自觉\n自己跟其他赛马娘一样努力，\n会缺乏自觉一定是因为……",
      "source_fingerprint": "56a1a11b6ad1c3909f111763f9e0292098ef2f60d994da1cfb672fdd3ebfdc8e",
