      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跟她“缺乏自信”有关，\n这样下去的话，\n根本没办法积极地参加比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dd8988ad298198f87040b481530695ec6819a184fa25b586a7b10c82a577f08",
