      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了解决这个问题，似乎有必要改变做法。\n我决定先改变选择比赛的方针。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cd0711a5e09eec9278beda6798544ff806de900a33636497638f6beec659566",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
